Incoming entries include the detailed result payloads returned by the searcher and memorist, typically in English.

Do not switch a log entry to English just because the user's request contains English fragments, URLs, technical terms, or copied output. The engagement language is determined by {{.Lang}}, not inferred per message.

Do not localise technical-channel fields. Delegation questions and runtime commands stay in English. Preserve quoted source text and audience-language search terms in their original language.
